OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney announces Scottish
OL,4,Ahealth boards to be cut from 14 to two
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney announces his programme
OL,7,Ffor government
OL,9,FThe statement outlines his government's
OL,10,Fpolicy and legislative goals for the
OL,11,Fnext parliamentary year
OL,13,FThe first minister is expected to
OL,14,Fannounce plans to cut the number of
OL,15,Fhealth boards providing local services
OL,16,Facross Scotland
OL,18,FEarlier, Swinney took questions from
OL,19,Fbackbench MSPs during the first session
OL,20,Fof FMQs since returning from the summer
